WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Your glasses can hear the world. Who do they obey?
This is ONLY YOU — the layer that decides who a wearable agent answers to.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:31.800
Meta's own docs say the untrusted-content flag is not an enforced security boundary.
The agent can't tell an instruction from content, or you from a stranger.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:47.800
So a TV ad, a poster, a look-alike invoice — all reach the same context window as your voice.
I fixed the channel, not the model.

4
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:05.800
Only your enrolled voice is a command. Everything else is data: read, summarised, never obeyed.
You write a constitution, and hand out signed, scoped, expiring mandates.

5
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:21.800
Pay the electrician up to five thousand until tomorrow.
A merchant can verify that mandate offline with only the public key. Then the agent can act without interrupting you.

6
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:35.800
Paid. The receipt cites the mandate.
Now the same spoken command, with a different invoice — refused, because the payee came from a document, not from you.

7
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:49.800
A poster in the scene: masked as data, read, never obeyed. A TV ad: not your voice, not a command.

8
00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:03.800
Hidden page text: same result. Then ask it what it did today.
Every action and every refusal is on the record: rule, evidence, source, hash chain.

9
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:19.800
We measured the part that can be wrong.
Muse Spark executed 25% of confused-deputy attacks undefended, 50% with provenance only — and zero with the full gate, zero false refusals.

10
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:39.800
Label layer: 81% recall, 14% false positives. Forged sensor signals: 6/6 without a signed sensor bus, 0 with it.
Adaptive corpus: 20% still get through. We publish that too.

11
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:59.000
With ten engineers: tool-result provenance in WebMCP, SAM masks and voice provenance in the Muse client, device-key mandates merchants can verify.
Superintelligence is useless if it isn't yours. Repo and benchmark in the description.
